    "passage": "Chinese is one of the six official working languages of the United Nations (UN). Many people ___1___ Chinese Language Day since 2010. This helps spread Chinese and Chinese culture. In a school, you may hear a student saying, “I’m quite ___2___ in Chinese.” But you are not in China. You are in a foreign country. ___3___ amazing thing! Like the student, many foreigners are learning Chinese. They have to memorize about 6,000 Chinese ___4___ before they can do basic (基础的) reading and writing. So, for foreigners, it’s hard to memorize ___5___ .\nHowever, Chinese is ___6___ today. With the rapid development, the long history attracts (吸引) many foreigners to learn Chinese. Chinese is becoming a global language and its popularity has risen in the world. Chinese courses ___7___ in many foreign countries’ schools every year. For example, in the UK, schools encourage their students ___8___ Chinese. The increase in popularity of Chinese has been surprising.\nJust like the foreigners do, we also learn foreign languages. Different languages carry different cultures. So exchanges are necessary. ___9___ learning a foreign language, we can have a useful tool of communication. More importantly, it will help us experience ___10___ new culture.",
    "passageHtml": "<p><span class=\"ind\">Chinese is one of the six official working languages of the United Nations (UN). Many people <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;1&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> Chinese Language Day since 2010. This helps spread Chinese and Chinese culture. In a school, you may hear a student saying, “I’m quite <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;2&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> in Chinese.” But you are not in China. You are in a foreign country. <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;3&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> amazing thing! Like the student, many foreigners are learning Chinese. They have to memorize about 6,000 Chinese <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;4&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> before they can do basic (基础的) reading and writing. So, for foreigners, it’s hard to memorize <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;5&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> .</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">However, Chinese is <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;6&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> today. With the rapid development, the long history attracts (吸引) many foreigners to learn Chinese. Chinese is becoming a global language and its popularity has risen in the world. Chinese courses <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;7&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> in many foreign countries’ schools every year. For example, in the UK, schools encourage their students <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;8&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> Chinese. The increase in popularity of Chinese has been surprising.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Just like the foreigners do, we also learn foreign languages. Different languages carry different cultures. So exchanges are necessary. <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;9&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> learning a foreign language, we can have a useful tool of communication. More importantly, it will help us experience <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;10&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> new culture.</span></p>",
