    "title": "七上A篇 · 八 英语老师的自我介绍",
    "passage": "Hello, my name is Miss Williams and I am your English teacher. This will be my fourth year teaching seventh graders at Guangming Middle School. I am so excited to meet you in my class. I think we are going to have a school year full of fun and learning.\n\nMy Favorites    Food: sandwiches    Drink: hot chocolate    Flower: roses    Season: summer   Sports: swimming, hiking   Hobbies: travelling, writing    Book: The Little Prince    Subjects: Science, Art\n\nWelcome to the Seventh Grade!\n\nI am glad to welcome you to the 2023—2024 school year! You will learn a lot of new knowledge (知识) this year. As a student, your job is to read, learn, think, ask questions and make mistakes. My job is to help you love learning. I will also teach you some life skills in my class. I wish a great school year with all of you! Contact Me Please feel free to ask me questions at any time.\n\nE-mail: meganwilliams@gmss.edu.com\n\nTel: 420-564-1516",
