    "title": "七上A篇 · 九 三个学生的个人物品",
    "passage": "Bonnie: Look at my erasers! They are interesting. They look like bread. I love collecting (收集) interesting and beautiful erasers, pens and many other things.\n\nRobert: This is my pen. It is from my sister. It is one of her “little carrots”. My sister often gives me her pens and rulers. I think she buys too many of these things. She also wants to give me her schoolbag, but I don’t want it. She does this because (因为) she wants to get a new one.\n\nNeil: This is my father’s watch. But now he gives it to me! I’m very happy. I can use it to look at the time. It can also tell me about my health (健康状况). And it can play music, too!",
