    "passage": "2026 “Beautiful Zhuhai” Photo Competition\n\nAre you interested in taking photos? Yes! Do you want to show your best photos of Zhuhai and win a big prize? Yes! Then join us and follow these steps NOW!\n\nSnap it!\n\nTake photos about “New Era (时代), New Zhuhai”. Photos should show Zhuhai’s changes and development in recent years, the wonderful life or special sights. A photo set (no more than 4 photos). We accept colour photos only. Black-and-white photos are not welcome.\n\nUpload it!\n\nGo to the website www.zhuhainews.cn and upload your photos there.\n\nDescribe it!\n\nTry to describe the photos within 50 words and try to catch people’s attention.\n\nShare it!\n\nShare the post with your friends and invite your friends to “like” your photos. The more likes you get, the more likely you will win.\n\nPrizes\n\nFirst prize\n2 winners\n3,000 yuan per person\nSecond prize\n5 winners\n2,000 yuan per person\nThird prize\n10 winners\n1,000 yuan per person\nAward of excellence\n30 winners\n200 yuan per person\n\nThe competition is open to ALL! Don’t forget to upload your photos before 31 December, 2026.",
