    "title": "九上阅读 · 十 珠海阳光旅行社推出的新疆7天冬季",
    "passage": "Winter vacation is coming soon! Zhuhai Sunshine Travel Company is now introducing a 7-day winter tour to Xinjiang. It will be an unforgettable trip for you!\n\nThere are two choices for your tour:\n\nPlane TourTransportation: By plane\nPrice: ¥ 8,000 per person (including flight tickets, hotel, and two meals each day).\nTrain TourTransportation: By train\nPrice: ¥ 3,500 per person (including train tickets, hotel, and only one meal each day).\n\nFood and Activities:\n\nFood: In Xinjiang, there are many delicious foods. One popular dish is samsa (烤包子). It is a meat pie that is filled with mutton, onions and carrots. Another favourite is naan—a kind of special bread. It can be round or long, thick or thin. Besides, a “meter kebab” (一米羊肉串) is also worth trying.\n\nSkiing: Xinjiang is a popular place for skiing because it has plenty of soft snow in winter. Another advantage of skiing here is that you can enjoy the beautiful views while skiing.\n\nCampfire party: Campfire parties are held at night, where people gather to sing and dance. You can even join in by wearing traditional Xinjiang costumes to experience the beauty of the local culture.\n\nImportant Tips: Xinjiang is very cold and dry in winter. Remember to bring your warmest clothes and drink plenty of water.\n\nIf you’re interested in this journey, please email us at zh.travel@example.com to book your trip",
    "passageHtml": "<p><span class=\"ind\">Winter vacation is coming soon! Zhuhai Sunshine Travel Company is now introducing a 7-day winter tour to Xinjiang. It will be an unforgettable trip for you!</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">There are two choices for your tour:</span></p><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:10px 0\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid var(--bd);font-size:14px\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.65\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\"><b>Plane TourTransportation:</b> By plane</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">Price: ¥ 8,000 per person (including flight tickets, hotel, and two meals each day).</p></td><td style=\"border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.65\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\"><b>Train TourTransportation:</b> By train</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">Price: ¥ 3,500 per person (including train tickets, hotel, and only one meal each day).</p></td></tr></table></div><p><span class=\"ind\"><b>Food and Activities:</b></span></p><p><span class=\"ind\"><b>Food:</b> In Xinjiang, there are many delicious foods. One popular dish is samsa (烤包子). It is a meat pie that is filled with mutton, onions and carrots. Another favourite is naan—a kind of special bread. It can be round or long, thick or thin. Besides, a “meter kebab” (一米羊肉串) is also worth trying.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\"><b>Skiing:</b> Xinjiang is a popular place for skiing because it has plenty of soft snow in winter. Another advantage of skiing here is that you can enjoy the beautiful views while skiing.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\"><b>Campfire party:</b> Campfire parties are held at night, where people gather to sing and dance. You can even join in by wearing traditional Xinjiang costumes to experience the beauty of the local culture.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\"><b>Important Tips:</b> Xinjiang is very cold and dry in winter. Remember to bring your warmest clothes and drink plenty of water.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">If you’re interested in this journey, please email us at zh.travel@example.com to book your trip<div style=\"text-align:center;margin:8px 0\"><img src=\"assets/images/jr_read9a_10_1.png\" alt=\"插图\" style=\"width:158px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px\"></div></span></p>",
    "intro": "本文主要介绍了珠海阳光旅行社推出的新疆7天冬季旅行，包括旅行方式、价格、食物、活动以及重要提示等信息。",
