    "title": "九上阅读 · 十七 太极拳作为中国文化遗产的一部分",
    "passage": "When you walk in a Chinese city early in the morning, you will see groups of people exercising in the park. You’ll see them moving through a set of slow movements. As their bodies move from one exercise to the next, their minds are focused only on their deep, relaxed breath.\n\nTai Chi is part of the national cultural heritage (遗产), which Chinese people take pride in. According to a survey in 2007, more than 2 million Americans practiced Tai Chi.\n\nTai Chi is called a mind-body type of exercise because it mixes meditation (冥想) with physical movement. Because it’s also a low-impact (低冲击) exercise, it may be suitable for older adults. But it’s a useful exercise for people of all ages.\n\nIf Tai Chi is something you might like to try, look for a Tai Chi class near you. Keep in mind that training programs are different in many ways. You might want to ask around for advice or try a class before you sign up.  ▲\n\nTai Chi is generally considered a low-risk exercise that is both safe and enjoyable. If you have any physical or medical problems, talk with your health care provider before starting any exercise program. And remember, although Tai Chi has many benefits, it can’t take the place of regular medical care.",
    "passageHtml": "<p><span class=\"ind\">When you walk in a Chinese city early in the morning, you will see groups of people exercising in the park. You’ll see them moving through a set of slow movements. As their bodies move from one exercise to the next, their minds are focused only on their deep, relaxed breath.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Tai Chi is part of the national cultural heritage (遗产), which Chinese people take pride in. According to a survey in 2007, more than 2 million Americans practiced Tai Chi.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Tai Chi is called a mind-body type of exercise because it mixes meditation (冥想) with physical movement. Because it’s also a low-impact (低冲击) exercise, it may be <u>suitable </u>for older adults. But it’s a useful exercise for people of all ages.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">If Tai Chi is something you might like to try, look for a Tai Chi class near you. Keep in mind that training programs are different in many ways. You might want to ask around for advice or try a class before you sign up. <u> ▲ </u></span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Tai Chi is generally considered a low-risk exercise that is both safe and enjoyable. If you have any physical or medical problems, talk with your health care provider before starting any exercise program. And remember, although Tai Chi has many benefits, it can’t take the place of regular medical care.</span></p>",
