    "title": "九上阅读 · 二十三 一项关于人们选择在线旅游还是线下",
    "passage": "Nowadays, with the development of science and technology, people in China can do many things online. Many people even travel online because they are too busy and have no time to travel. But there are many people choosing offline tours (线下旅游). I did a survey (调查) among 500 women and 500 men from November 1st to November 2nd. Here are the results.\n\nFrom the diagram 1, we found that 78% of people like offline tours. They think they can see, hear, smell and touch something. They can also meet different people and try all kinds of local food. What’s more, they think that read ten thousand books, and travel ten thousand miles.\nSome people think online tours are better because they can learn about the places of interest without spending much time. From the diagram 2, we found that most men choose online tours because they can visit more places with less money. Most women want to visit places of interest and take pictures during offline tours.\n\nIf you want to travel, which will you choose, online tours or offline tours?",
