    "title": "九上阅读 · 三十三 重庆大足石刻景点的基本信息",
    "passage": "Welcome to Dazu Rock Carvings (石刻)\n\nDazu, in the west of Chongqing, is famous worldwide as the Home of Rock Carvings. Over 60,000 carved stone figures are spread around 76 places in Dazu. The art of Dazu appeared in the late Tang Dynasty and became popular and famous in the Song Dynasty. It’s an important part of Chinese culture and history.\n\n※ Opening Hours※\n\n9:00 a.m.—6:00 p.m. at Mount Baoding & Beishan\n\n7:30 p.m.—11:00 p.m. at Beishan (night tour)\n\n※ How to Get Here※\n\n▲From Jiangbei Airport  ¥58\n\nThere is a bus, which directly goes to Dazu District, only two shifts (班) every day at 12:30 and 17:30.\n\n▲From the bus station  ¥52\n\nIn the Caiyuanba and Chenjiang bus stations, there are buses going to Dazu District every half-hour.\n\n※ Notes※\n\nMost of the figures are Buddhist statues (佛像), but Taoist (道教) and Confucian stone figures can also be seen.\n\n▲English guides are available for 260 yuan.\n\n▲Don’t make noise or dress improperly.\n\n▲Call023-43722268 or visit http://www.dzshike. com for more information.\n\n▲Meet emergencies or have physical problems, please call 023-43785774 for Mount Baoding, 023-43721274 for Beishan and 023-43735811 for Beishan night tour.",
    "passageHtml": "<p class=\"ct\"><b>Welcome to Dazu Rock Carvings (</b><b>石刻</b><b>) </b></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Dazu, in the west of Chongqing, is famous worldwide as the Home of Rock Carvings. Over 60,000 carved stone figures are spread around 76 places in Dazu. The art of Dazu appeared in the late Tang Dynasty and became popular and famous in the Song Dynasty. It’s an important part of Chinese culture and history.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\"><b>※ Opening Hours※</b></span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">9:00 a.m.—6:00 p.m. at Mount Baoding &amp; Beishan</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">7:30 p.m.—11:00 p.m. at Beishan (night tour)</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\"><b>※ How to Get Here※</b></span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">▲From Jiangbei Airport  ¥58</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">There is a bus, which directly goes to Dazu District, only two shifts (班) every day at 12:30 and 17:30.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">▲From the bus station  ¥52</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">In the Caiyuanba and Chenjiang bus stations, there are buses going to Dazu District every half-hour.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\"><b>※ Notes※</b></span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Most of the figures are Buddhist statues (佛像), but Taoist (道教) and Confucian stone figures can also be seen.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">▲English guides are available for 260 yuan.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">▲Don’t make noise or dress improperly.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">▲Call023-43722268 or visit http://www.dzshike. com for more information.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">▲Meet emergencies or have physical problems, please call 023-43785774 for Mount Baoding, 023-43721274 for Beishan and 023-43735811 for Beishan night tour.</span></p>",
