    "passage": "Some students often leave (遗留) their own things here and there in the school and forget to take them away. Here is the Lost and Found notice of No. 9 Middle School.\n\nFound\nI found a bus card in the hallway (走廊) of Grade Seven on the first floor. There is no name or photo on it. It’s green and new. I will give it to Mr. Ning. You can ask him for it if you lose it.\nYongze\nFound\nI found that I took someone else’s uniform jacket by mistake. Mine is in my desk. I take it from the sports hall (体育馆). The size is M for girl. I will make it clean before you get it. I’m so sorry and please call me at 13920031232.\nZiying\nLost\nI lost my new watch on the playground this morning. It’s my birthday gift from my grandma. It’s black and white. I love it so much so I must find it. If you find it please give it to Mrs. Wan in Class One, Grade Seven. Thanks a lot!\nHaoran\nLost\nI am so sad because I lost my keys. The pink Peppa Pig is on the key. I use them every day so it’s important for me. I think I lost them in the computer room. Do you see them? Please give the keys to Ms. Chen when you find them. Thank you very much.\nXiaoxuan",
