    "title": "七下读写综合 · 一 徐悲鸿纪念馆参观指南与珠海博物馆之旅",
    "passage": "Xu Beihong Memorial Hall–Visitor Guide Welcome to the Xu Beihong Memorial Hall! This museum is to remember Xu Beihong, a great Chinese artist. He was famous for painting horses. He loved his country and art very much. His wife, Liao Jingwen, gave his artworks to the country so everyone could enjoy them. Now, there are more than 1,200 of his art pieces in the museum. Here you can see Chinese paintings, oil paintings and so on.\nFloor Guide ● 1st floor: service desk, gift shops, special show rooms for new artworks.● 2nd floor: Mr. Xu’s life and artworks — Chinese paintings and oil paintings. His famous horses are here!● 3rd floor: drawings, calligraphy and old papers.● 4th floor: activity areas for fun art and special exhibitions. | Free Guided Tours Want to learn more? Join a free guided tour! Tour time: at 10:00 AM and 2:00 PM every Tuesday to Sunday. Please arrive 10 minutes before the tour.Meeting place: service desk on the 1st floor.\nRules for Visitors ● Keep your voice down.● Don’t smoke.●  ▲ | Opening Hours Tuesday to Sunday: 9:00 AM–5:00 PM.Closed on Mondays. | Transportation By bus: Take Bus 22, 47, 88, or 409 to Jishuitan Bridge South Stop.By subway: Take Line 2 to Jishuitan Station.",
    "passageHtml": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--mu);font-size:13.5px\"><strong>A．回答问题：</strong>请阅读下面短文，根据所提供的信息，回答五个问题。要求所写答案语法正确、语义完整。</p><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Xu Beihong Memorial Hall–Visitor Guide<br>Welcome to the Xu Beihong Memorial Hall! This museum is to remember Xu Beihong, a great Chinese artist. He was famous for painting horses. He loved his country and art very much. His wife, Liao Jingwen, gave his artworks to the country so everyone could enjoy them. Now, there are more than 1,200 of his art pieces in the museum. Here you can see Chinese paintings, oil paintings and so on.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Floor Guide<br>● 1st floor: service desk, gift shops, special show rooms for new artworks.● 2nd floor: Mr. Xu’s life and artworks — Chinese paintings and oil paintings. His famous horses are here!● 3rd floor: drawings, calligraphy and old papers.● 4th floor: activity areas for fun art and special exhibitions.</td><td>Free Guided Tours<br>Want to learn more? Join a free guided tour!<br>Tour time: at 10:00 AM and 2:00 PM every Tuesday to Sunday. Please arrive 10 minutes before the tour.Meeting place: service desk on the 1st floor.</td></tr><tr><td>Rules for Visitors<br>● Keep your voice down.● Don’t smoke.●  ▲</td><td>Opening Hours<br>Tuesday to Sunday: 9:00 AM–5:00 PM.Closed on Mondays.</td><td>Transportation<br>By bus: Take Bus 22, 47, 88, or 409 to Jishuitan Bridge South Stop.By subway: Take Line 2 to Jishuitan Station.</td></tr></tbody></table>",
    "intro": "本文是一篇应用文，主要是一份徐悲鸿纪念馆的游客指南，介绍了纪念馆的楼层分布、免费导游服务、游客须知、开放时间以及交通方式等信息。",
